<outline text="Protocols for Human-AI Effectiveness"><outline text="Hyptheses"><outline text="Humans need to be in the loop"><outline text="Due to human constraints"><outline text="Due to their own (human) lack of clarity about their intentions"></outline>
<outline text="Due to intentions evolving with evidence"></outline>
<outline text="Due to their poor ability to communicate intentions"><outline text="Especially through limited means like text and images"></outline>
</outline>
</outline>
<outline text="Due to AI constraints"><outline text="Due to AI lacking intentionality"><outline text="Always true, due to bounded taxonomy"><outline text="Deterministic"></outline>
<outline text="Stochastic"></outline>
<outline text="Intentional"></outline>
</outline>
</outline>
<outline text="Due to Ai lacking causal understanding"><outline text="World models may augment this"></outline>
</outline>
<outline text="Due to hallucinations"><outline text="Always possible with finite training data"></outline>
</outline>
</outline>
</outline>
<outline text="Protocols are the interface for humans in the loop"><outline text="To supply intentionality"></outline>
<outline text="For AI to execute"></outline>
<outline text="To produce a coherent transhuman experience"><outline text="Human + AI + Protocol &gt; Human + AI &gt; Human"></outline>
</outline>
</outline>
<outline text="Protocols for effective human collaboration extend well to transhuman collaboration"><outline text="Because AI was trained on human data"><outline text="And can’t be self-training on human domains"><outline text="Unlike e.g. well-bounded domains like chess"></outline>
</outline>
</outline>
<outline text="Because the protocols and their results need to be inspectable (predicated on humans need to be in the loop reasoning)"></outline>
<outline text="Because human constraints are a limiting factor"></outline>
<outline text="Because humans have access to context that AI will never have without the human"></outline>
<outline text="Because humans are the final arbiter of success or failure in relation to their intentions"></outline>
<outline text="Because humans inherit the real-world consequences"><outline text="And will be accountable to other humans in existential ways"></outline>
</outline>
</outline>
</outline>
